"这是什么" = "What is this";
"余音是一款轻量的播客客户端：发现好节目、订阅收听、离线下载、随时续播，专注「听」本身。macOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不引入任何第三方 SDK。" = "Reverb is a lightweight podcast client: discover shows, subscribe and listen, download for offline, and resume anytime — focused on listening itself. The macOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs.";
"主要功能" = "Features";
"· 发现：按地区与分类浏览每日热门" = "· Discover: browse daily charts by region and category";
"· 搜索：按名字或直接粘贴 RSS 地址" = "· Search: by name or by pasting an RSS URL";
"· 视频链接：粘贴 B 站视频链接或 BV 号，直接当单集听（不登录；视频来源的单集不提供下载）" = "· Video links: paste a Bilibili video link or BV ID and listen to it as an episode (no sign-in; episodes from video links cannot be downloaded)";
"· 频道分享：生成含 Logo、频道名、简介与余音落款的图片" = "· Share shows: create an image with the logo, show name, description and a Reverb signature";
"· 电台：随机漫游，或按时段与情境推荐" = "· Radio: roam at random, or get picks by time of day and context";
"· 追更：订阅频道播过的单集全在这一栏，按时间倒序翻看，可在页头手动刷新，可单独设这一栏的播放模式" = "· Updates: every episode of your subscribed shows in one column, newest first; refresh from the header and give this column its own play mode";
"· 音阁：订阅、收藏、下载、待播、历史、批注六栏管理" = "· Library: subscriptions, favorites, downloads, up next, history and notes in six sections";
"· 批量与直达：点任意单集封面直达它所属的频道；多个列表可切换「选择」把一批一次加入待播" = "· Batch and jump: click any episode cover to open its show; several lists have a Select mode to add a batch to Up Next at once";
"· 离线下载：下载的单集长期留在本机" = "· Offline: downloaded episodes stay on this Mac";
"· 播放缓存：播过的单集自动留在本机，下次直接本地起播；断网时已加载的列表与封面仍可浏览，可在设置一键清除" = "· Playback cache: episodes you play stay on this Mac and start locally next time; loaded lists and artwork remain browsable offline, clearable in Settings";
"· 播放：倍速、快进快退、睡眠定时、播放模式（顺序 / 单曲循环 / 随机）、自动续播，以及系统媒体键与「正在播放」" = "· Playback: speed, skip back and forward, sleep timer, play modes (in order / repeat one / shuffle), autoplay next, plus media keys and Now Playing";
"· 逐字稿：优先显示发布方提供的逐字稿，没有时在本机转成文字并随进度高亮（本机转写需 macOS 26）" = "· Transcript: shows the publisher’s transcript when there is one, otherwise turns the episode into text on this Mac, highlighted as it plays (on-device transcription needs macOS 26)";
"· 批注：记下这一秒和此刻的一句话；音阁「批注」栏把它们连成时间线，点一下从那一句接着听" = "· Notes: mark that second with a sentence; the Library's Notes section strings them into a timeline — click one to resume from that line";
"· 节目笔记：播放页横滑查看简介" = "· Show notes: swipe across the player to read the description";
"· 备份：勾选分区导出或恢复备份（与手机端格式互通），也能导入导出 OPML" = "· Backup: export or restore the sections you pick (compatible with the mobile apps), and import or export OPML";
"· 外观：深色 / 浅色 / 跟随系统、字号、主题配色、多语言" = "· Appearance: dark / light / system, text size, accent color, multiple languages";
"设计理念" = "Design";
"美学上取「水墨 + 青瓷 + 梁金」的底色，名字与图标呼应「余音绕梁」——声波环绕横梁，余韵不散。" = "Visually it draws on ink, celadon and beam-gold — the name and icon echo an echo circling the rafters: sound waves around a beam, lingering.";
"取源上坚持全链路免费、无需登录、无需任何 API Key：检索一律基于公开来源，最终始终回到发布方自己的 RSS，直接流式播放原始音频——版权干净、成本为零。" = "For sources it stays free end to end, with no login and no API key: discovery relies only on public sources, and playback always returns to the publisher's own RSS, streaming the original audio — clean rights, zero cost.";
"隐私上，订阅、历史和下载保存在设备本地，不向开发者自动上传，也不用于跨应用追踪。" = "For privacy, subscriptions, history and downloads stay on your device; nothing is uploaded to the developer automatically and nothing is used for cross-app tracking.";
"余音 macOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不引入任何第三方 SDK 或统计组件。以下是所用的系统能力与数据来源。" = "The macOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs or analytics. Here are the system capabilities and data sources it uses.";
"系统能力" = "System capabilities";
"系统框架" = "System framework";
"数据来源" = "Data sources";
"以下为公开的播客目录/检索接口，仅用于检索与榜单；音频始终来自发布方原始 RSS，本应用不转存、不代理。" = "These are public podcast directory and search APIs, used only for search and charts; audio always comes from the publisher's original RSS. This app never re-hosts or proxies it.";
"播客发布方自己的 RSS 地址" = "The publisher's own RSS feed";
"隐私政策与数据说明" = "Privacy policy and data notes";
"余音以本机处理为主。没有开发者后端、账号、广告、统计、归因、第三方登录、第三方推送、崩溃上报或跨应用追踪。订阅、历史、收藏、下载、收听统计、设置、批注与运行日志都在本机处理，不会自动上传给开发者；macOS 版只使用系统自带的框架，不含任何第三方 SDK。若你在系统设置里开启 Time Machine 备份，系统会把本机数据一并备份到你自己的备份磁盘。" = "Reverb processes most data on your device. It has no developer backend, account, ads, analytics, attribution, third-party login or push, crash reporting, or cross-app tracking. Subscriptions, history, favorites, downloads, listening statistics, settings, notes and runtime logs are processed locally and are not automatically uploaded to the developer. The macOS build uses only Apple's system frameworks and bundles no third-party SDKs. If you enable Time Machine in System Settings, the system backs this data up to your own backup disk along with the rest of your Mac.";
"联网时，搜索词、地区或分类会发给 Apple、fyyd、gpodder 等公开目录；RSS、封面与音频直接请求发布方或托管方，因此对方会看到 IP 地址、User-Agent 和访问资源。日志可能包含节目或单集标识及所访问服务的主机名，只有你主动分享或导出时才离开应用。详情请阅读完整隐私政策。" = "When online, search terms, region or category are sent to public directories such as Apple, fyyd and gpodder. RSS, artwork and audio are requested directly from publishers or hosts, which exposes your IP address, User-Agent and requested resource to them. Logs may contain show or episode identifiers and the host names of accessed services; they leave the app only when you choose to share or export them. Read the full policy for details.";
"视频链接（可选）：在搜索框粘贴一个视频页面链接或 BV 号，这一条视频会被当作单集来听——本应用向视频站公开接口（api.bilibili.com）请求标题、封面与音频地址，再从它的内容分发网络（*.bilivideo.com 等）直接流式播放，并像其他单集一样自动缓存到本机。请求不登录账号、不带任何用户标识；为取得音频地址，这类请求使用浏览器身份的 User-Agent 与视频站的来源页，对方因此会看到这些信息与你的 IP 地址。这类单集不提供「下载」。" = "Video links (optional): paste a video page link or a BV ID into the search field and that video is played as an episode. The app asks the video site’s public API (api.bilibili.com) for the title, cover and audio address, then streams from its content delivery network (*.bilivideo.com and similar) and caches the audio locally like any other episode. The requests do not sign in and carry no user identifiers; to obtain the audio address they are sent with a browser User-Agent and the video site’s referring page, so the site sees those and your IP address. Episodes from video links cannot be downloaded.";
"离线语音转文字（可选）：用系统自带的 Speech 框架在本机完成，首次使用某种语言时由系统下载对应模型；音频不上传、不出设备，也不经过任何服务器。该功能可在设置里关闭。" = "Offline speech-to-text (optional). It runs on this Mac using Apple's Speech framework; the system downloads a model for each language the first time you use it. Audio is never uploaded, never leaves the device and never passes through any server. You can turn it off in Settings.";
"点击「同意并继续」表示你已阅读并接受本政策。" = "Clicking “Agree and continue” means you have read and accept this policy.";
"阅读完整隐私政策" = "Read the full privacy policy";
"同意并继续" = "Agree and continue";
"不同意并退出" = "Decline and exit";
